                        </div>
                        <div class="swiper-slide !w-auto px-8">
                            <img src="/img/logos/binks.png" alt="BINKS" class="h-4 opacity-60 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all object-contain" onerror="this.outerHTML='<span class=\'text-2xl font-bold text-gray-400\'>BINKS</span>'" />
                        </div>
                        <div class="swiper-slide !w-auto px-8">
                            <img src="/img/logos/gfs.png" alt="GFS" class="h-9 opacity-60 grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all object-contain" onerror="this.outerHTML='<span class=\'text-2xl font-bold text-gray-400\'>GFS</span>'" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 13. PREGUNTAS FRECUENTES -->
        <section class="py-16 bg-industrial-gray px-6 md:px-12 border-t border-gray-200/50" id="faq">
            <div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl">
                <div class="text-center mb-16 faq-header">
                    <span class="text-brand-lime font-bold tracking-widest text-xs mb-2 uppercase inline-block bg-brand-lime/10 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full">Preguntas Técnicas</span>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-saira italic font-semibold text-brand-navy uppercase mt-4">Preguntas Frecuentes</h2>
                </div>

                <div class="space-y-4">
                    <details name="faq" class="group border border-gray-300/80 rounded-xl bg-white overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 open:shadow-md" open>
                        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center px-6 py-5 font-saira font-semibold italic text-brand-navy uppercase text-base md:text-lg cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors list-none select-none">
                            <span>¿Qué es un sistema de aplicación de recubrimientos?</span>
                            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/5 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-bold text-xl after:content-['+'] group-open:after:content-['-']"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="px-6 pb-6 pt-2 border-t border-gray-100 text-gray-600 font-light text-base leading-relaxed details-content-reveal">
                            Es un conjunto de herramientas, tecnologías y consolas diseñadas para dosificar y proyectar fluidos como pinturas, adhesivos, ceras o lubricantes de forma uniforme y a presiones controladas sobre cualquier tipo de superficie.
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details name="faq" class="group border border-gray-300/80 rounded-xl bg-white overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 open:shadow-md">
                        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center px-6 py-5 font-saira font-semibold italic text-brand-navy uppercase text-base md:text-lg cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors list-none select-none">
                            <span>¿Cuál es la diferencia entre aspersión Airless y Air Assisted Airless?</span>
                            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/5 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-bold text-xl after:content-['+'] group-open:after:content-['-']"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="px-6 pb-6 pt-2 border-t border-gray-100 text-gray-600 font-light text-base leading-relaxed details-content-reveal">
                            Airless pulveriza el recubrimiento únicamente a través de la alta presión hidráulica de una bomba, ideal para viscosidades altas y micrajes gruesos. Air Assisted Airless añade un aporte de aire comprimido a baja presión en la boquilla, logrando una atomización más fina y
                            controlada.
                        </div>
                    </details>

                    <details name="faq" class="group border border-gray-300/80 rounded-xl bg-white overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 open:shadow-md">
                        <summary class="flex justify-between items-center px-6 py-5 font-saira font-semibold italic text-brand-navy uppercase text-base md:text-lg cursor-pointer hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors list-none select-none">
                            <span>¿Qué ventajas ofrece un sistema electrostático?</span>
                            <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-brand-navy/5 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-navy font-bold text-xl after:content-['+'] group-open:after:content-['-']"></span>
                        </summary>
                        <div class="px-6 pb-6 pt-2 border-t border-gray-100 text-gray-600 font-light text-base leading-relaxed details-content-reveal">
                            El sistema carga eléctricamente las partículas de pintura para que sean atraídas por la pieza (que actúa como tierra). Esto reduce drásticamente el overspray, maximiza el rendimiento del recubrimiento y garantiza un acabado uniforme en caras traseras y bordes.
                        </div>
                    </details>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 14. GALERÍA DE PROYECTOS -->
        <section class="py-16 bg-white px-6 md:px-12" id="galeria">
            <div class="container mx-auto">
                <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 gallery-header">
                    <span class="text-brand-lime font-bold tracking-widest text-xs mb-2 uppercase inline-block bg-brand-lime/10 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full">Galería</span>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-saira italic font-semibold text-brand-navy uppercase mt-4">Proyectos</h2>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 mt-4 font-light">Casos de éxito de sistemas de suministro y dosificación instalados.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 gallery-grid">
                    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow group border border-gray-200">
                        <img src="/images/soluciones/aplicacion-recubrimientos/recubrimientos-7.webp" alt="Instalación de Aplicación Automática" class="w-full h-64 object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow group border border-gray-200">
                        <img src="/images/soluciones/aplicacion-recubrimientos/recubrimientos-8.webp" alt="Consola de Control de Fluidos" class="w-full h-64 object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
                    </div>
                    <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-lg shadow group border border-gray-200">
                        <img src="/images/soluciones/aplicacion-recubrimientos/recubrimientos-6.webp" alt="Robots de Aspersión de Precisión" class="w-full h-64 object-cover transform group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" />
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <!-- CDNs y Configuración de Animación Scroll / Lenis -->
    <script is:inline>
        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
            // 1. Inicializar Lenis (Smooth Scroll)
            const lenis = new Lenis({
                duration: 1.2,
                easing: (t) => Math.min(1, 1.001 - Math.pow(2, -10 * t)),
                smoothWheel: true,
            })
            function raf(time) {
                lenis.raf(time)
                requestAnimationFrame(raf)
            }
            requestAnimationFrame(raf)

            // 2. Conectar GSAP con Lenis y animar
            if (typeof gsap !== 'undefined') {
                gsap.ticker.add((time) => {
                    lenis.raf(time * 1000)
                })
                gsap.ticker.lagSmoothing(0)

                // Actualizar ScrollTrigger con Lenis scroll
                if (typeof ScrollTrigger !== 'undefined') {
                    lenis.on('scroll', ScrollTrigger.update)
                }

                // Animación Hero al cargar
                gsap.from('.hero-section-text > *', {
                    y: 35,
                    opacity: 0,
                    duration: 1,
                    stagger: 0.15,
                    ease: 'power3.out',
                })

                // Animaciones al hacer scroll con ScrollTrigger
                if (typeof ScrollTrigger !== 'undefined') {
                    // Animación Introducción
                    gsap.from('.intro-text > *', {
                        scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#introduccion', start: 'top 80%' },
                        y: 30,
                        opacity: 0,
                        duration: 0.8,
                        stagger: 0.12,
                        ease: 'power2.out',
                    })
                    gsap.from('.intro-image', {
                        scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#introduccion', start: 'top 80%' },
                        x: 40,
                        opacity: 0,
                        duration: 0.9,
                        ease: 'power2.out',
                    })

                    // Pain points grid
                    gsap.from('.pain-points-grid > div', {
                        scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.pain-points-grid', start: 'top 85%' },
                        y: 40,
                        opacity: 0,
                        duration: 0.8,
                        stagger: 0.15,
                        ease: 'power2.out',
                    })

                    // Ingeniería grid
                    gsap.from('#ingenieria .grid > div', {
                        scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#ingenieria', start: 'top 80%' },
                        y: 30,
                        opacity: 0,
                        duration: 0.7,
                        stagger: 0.15,
                        ease: 'power2.out',
                        clearProps: 'all',
                    })

                    // Diferenciadores grid
                    gsap.from('.diferenciadores-grid > div', {
                        scrollTrigger: {
                            trigger: '.diferenciadores-grid',
                            start: 'top 85%',
                        },
                        y: 30,
                        opacity: 0,
                        duration: 0.7,
                        stagger: 0.15,
                        ease: 'power2.out',
                    })

                    // Especificaciones
                    gsap.from('#datos-tecnicos table, #datos-tecnicos .grid > div', {
                        scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#datos-tecnicos', start: 'top 80%' },
                        y: 40,
                        opacity: 0,
                        duration: 0.8,
                        stagger: 0.15,
                        ease: 'power2.out',
                    })

                    // Conclusión
                    gsap.from('#conclusion > div', {
                        scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#conclusion', start: 'top 85%' },
                        y: 30,
                        opacity: 0,
                        duration: 0.8,
                        ease: 'power2.out',
                    })

                    // Normativas text
                    gsap.from('.norms-text > *', {
                        scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#normas', start: 'top 80%' },
                        y: 30,
                        opacity: 0,
                        duration: 0.8,
                        stagger: 0.12,
                        ease: 'power2.out',
                    })

                    // Normativas grid items
                    gsap.from('.norms-grid > div', {
                        scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.norms-grid', start: 'top 85%' },
                        y: 20,
                        opacity: 0,
                        duration: 0.6,
                        stagger: 0.1,
                        ease: 'power2.out',
                        clearProps: 'opacity,transform',
                    })

                    // FAQ list
                    gsap.from('#faq details', {
                        scrollTrigger: { trigger: '#faq', start: 'top 80%' },
                        y: 20,
                        opacity: 0,
                        duration: 0.6,
                        stagger: 0.1,
                        ease: 'power2.out',
                        clearProps: 'opacity,transform',
                    })

                    // Gallery grid
                    gsap.from('.gallery-grid > div', {
                        scrollTrigger: { trigger: '.gallery-grid', start: 'top 85%' },
                        y: 30,
                        opacity: 0,
                        duration: 0.7,
                        stagger: 0.12,
                        ease: 'power2.out',
                        clearProps: 'opacity,transform',
                    })
                }
            }

            // 3. Inicializar Marquee Swiper
            if (typeof Swiper !== 'undefined') {
                new Swiper('.marquee-swiper', {
                    loop: true,
                    speed: 3000,
                    autoplay: {
                        delay: 0,
                        disableOnInteraction: false,
                    },
                    slidesPerView: 'auto',
                    spaceBetween: 10,
                    allowTouchMove: false,
                    freeMode: true,
                })
            }

            // 5. Controlador de Tabs Técnicos
            const tabBtns = document.querySelectorAll('.tech-tab-btn')
            const tabPanels = document.querySelectorAll('.tech-tab-panel')

            tabBtns.forEach((btn) => {
                btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
                    const targetTabId = btn.getAttribute('data-tab')

                    tabBtns.forEach((b) => {
                        b.classList.remove('active', 'border-brand-lime', 'text-brand-lime', 'bg-brand-lime/10')
                        b.classList.add('border-transparent', 'text-gray-400', 'bg-transparent')
                    })

                    btn.classList.add('active', 'border-brand-lime', 'text-brand-lime', 'bg-brand-lime/10')
                    btn.classList.remove('border-transparent', 'text-gray-400', 'bg-transparent')

                    tabPanels.forEach((panel) => {
                        panel.classList.add('hidden', 'opacity-0', 'translate-y-4')
                        panel.classList.remove('opacity-100', 'translate-y-0')
                    })

                    const activePanel = document.getElementById(targetTabId)
                    if (activePanel) {
                        activePanel.classList.remove('hidden')
                        setTimeout(() => {
                            activePanel.classList.remove('opacity-0', 'translate-y-4')
                            activePanel.classList.add('opacity-100', 'translate-y-0')
                        }, 20)
                    }

                    if (typeof ScrollTrigger !== 'undefined') {
                        ScrollTrigger.refresh()
                    }
                })
            })
        })

        // 4. Refrescar ScrollTrigger al cargar completamente la página (imágenes, fuentes, etc.)
        window.addEventListener('load', () => {
            if (typeof ScrollTrigger !== 'undefined') {
                ScrollTrigger.refresh()
            }
        })
    </script>
</Layout>
